      "instructions": "Read the approved launch brief and exact asset revision, current CMS or channel state, provider publication/send receipt if any, and two inbound form or CRM events. Join by campaign/source IDs, record consent and suppression, and show a duplicate event explicitly. CMS or repository, email or ad platforms, analytics, form source, CRM, calendar, and project tracker; exports can support an initial read-only ledger. A named SaaS provider is not verified access."
